    "Name": "Dragon",
    "Details": "The Dragon DRG-2ALAG drops the flamer of the DRG-1ALAG to instead fit another ton of ammunition for the Autocannon/10. Otherwise the designs are identical.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
