  "StockRole": "Skirmisher & Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Dragon is a heavy BattleMech originally designed in a bid to replace the Shadow Hawk. A close assault 'Mech, its versatile design allows it to be used in both offensive and defensive operations. It boasts above-average firepower and plenty of ammunition for extended combat, while having a high top speed for a heavy 'Mech. Armor coverage for the Dragon is thick around the torso, and especially the rear, for when it is surrounded by opponents, while the squat design gives it a smaller profile and makes it harder to knock over. The Dragon's only major problem is it requires frequent maintenance and/or overhaul of its hip actuator",
